// Copy to Local.xcconfig (gitignored; make ios-project writes an empty one). Your Apple team id
// signs a build for a device (Xcode → Settings → Accounts, or Membership in the developer
// account); the simulator needs none.
NT_TEAM_ID =
// For make ios-testflight, and make ios-device without Xcode's account: an App Store Connect API
// key that may upload builds (Users and Access › Integrations › App Store Connect API, role App
// Manager or Admin). Its .p8 goes to ~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/AuthKey_<key id>.p8
// (chmod 600); empty, Xcode's account signs in.
NT_ASC_KEY_ID =
NT_ASC_ISSUER_ID =
